    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492620/extras/6e2fbc66f4c0d3145f99ab9dbe1d28ae.avif?t=1747511952\" /></span><br>Welcome to Fattening Career, a Visual Novel that centers around feeding, weight gain, and a touch of breast expansion. In this game, you\u2019ll have the opportunity to become an A+ Feeder, a chocolatier, a lab researcher, and more.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492620/extras/cb4c57abbb8b6830f8e73003a78edeb5.avif?t=1747511952\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492620/extras/0c2c3ddee48c385ba290e2f9a3ec7a35.poster.avif?t=1747511952\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492620/extras/0c2c3ddee48c385ba290e2f9a3ec7a35.webm?t=1747511952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492620/extras/0c2c3ddee48c385ba290e2f9a3ec7a35.mp4?t=1747511952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Fattening Career offers 16 beautiful ladies with their own unique stories, personalities, and body types.<br>From shy bottom-heavy blonde study partner to extravagant pink-haired top-heavy popular streamer, there is someone for everyone.<br>With no restrictions to how many love interests you can pursue, you'll be able to build the ultimate harem.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492620/extras/1a59559d2059f50238628aa3874a3302.avif?t=1747511952\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492620/extras/6b65b6a06774d4518f75dd50f53a27bc.poster.avif?t=1747511952\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492620/extras/6b65b6a06774d4518f75dd50f53a27bc.webm?t=1747511952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492620/extras/6b65b6a06774d4518f75dd50f53a27bc.mp4?t=1747511952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Most sexual interactions are fully animated. <br>With high-quality jiggle physics, you'll be able to witness the extra pounds shift around in real time.<br>All sex animations are planned to include female moans and general sex sounds.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492620/extras/4d68aa3f2425622c4a41cf1d0aa58808.avif?t=1747511952\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492620/extras/3a6486c4c91d89190e367994ca87f74d.poster.avif?t=1747511952\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492620/extras/3a6486c4c91d89190e367994ca87f74d.webm?t=1747511952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492620/extras/3a6486c4c91d89190e367994ca87f74d.mp4?t=1747511952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>With the unique weight gain stage system, your choices will directly impact the size of your companions.<br>Each woman's size is always represented visually throughout the game, with ever-changing interactions based on their weight.<br>You can buy many sweets and loads of junk food for your favorite girl to speed up their gain or choose to slow down the growth.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492620/extras/44d5bd64459fde7aa77a8c1593d35993.avif?t=1747511952\" /></span><br>Fattening Career contains the following fetishes:<br>- Weight Gain/Feederism(Major focus)<br>- BBW/SSBBW(Major focus)<br>- Breast Expansion(Major focus)<br>- Harem<br>- Lactation<br>- Pregnancy(Planned)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492620/extras/500d7ed7b82e6d74ceceb708a103d2c3.avif?t=1747511952\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492620/extras/83eb73374507423d90d728d7d6080ae5.avif?t=1747511952\" /></span><br>This game is a passion project by a solo artist/developer and few writers. I love to hear what you think about the game.<br>Feel free to share your opinions, ideas and criticisms about the game - <strong>I listen to your feedback.</strong>",
